              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "il portavoce — \"the spokesperson\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Il portavoce non ha voluto rispondere. The spokesperson would not answer."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One form for a man or a woman; plural unchanged: i portavoce."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "portavoce joins porta, from portare \"to carry\", and voce \"voice\", from Latin vōx (Lewis & Short): the one who carries the voice."
            }
          ]
        },
