              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "la conferenza stampa — \"the press conference\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Alle undici c'è una conferenza stampa. There is a press conference at eleven."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "La stampa is the press; una conferenza on its own is a lecture or a talk."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "conferenza is a learned word usually traced to Medieval Latin cōnferentia, built on cōnferre \"to bring together\" (Lewis & Short); stampa \"the press\" is built on stampare \"to print\", which EtymDB traces to a Frankish verb."
            }
          ]
        },
